## Enforcement loop

| When | Action |
| ---| --- |
| Reviewing existing ANVIL workers / MCP servers / plugins / infra | Flag rule-1–3 violations; propose revert path OR record rule-4 justification |
| Writing new code | Reach for the SDK first; if none exists, say so explicitly before rolling custom |
| Bumping versions | Read changelog, fix breakage forward, commit with note |
| Autonomous fix applied | Include in the next Delta Summary with rule-compliance note |


